QWEN-EXO-booster PRO6000 kernel adaptations

Portions of the SM120 persistent MoE, grouped INT8 dense/HC, GDN output,
Top-K and speculative-sampling implementations are adapted from:
  SSHdotCodes/qwen-3.8-flash-next-pro6000
  https://github.com/SSHdotCodes/qwen-3.8-flash-next-pro6000
  revision 1233bf628f42940ec8e4fb060fa35c1a30eecfc2
